      "releaseNotes": "• New iPhone layout: the logo sits in the middle, controls are grouped on both sides.\n• Pinch to zoom into any effect screen and pan with two fingers. Knobs stay put while you zoom.\n• Live visuals for Grain Delay, Chorus, Phaser, Flanger, Delay, Distortion and more.\n• A/B now compares two complete chains.\n• Undo and redo cover adding, removing, reordering and bypassing effects.\n• Input gain in Audio settings.\n• Loading a chain asks whether to save the current one.\n• A larger, readable preset list on iPhone.\n• Effect screens open faster.",
      "version": "1.0.1",
